+
+Both exited `0`.  `krun` ended with `<k> .K </k>`, `<exc> NoExc </exc>`, and
+`<exit-code> 0 </exit-code>`.  Its heap contained the expected sequences for
+`1`, `2`, `8`, `25`, `70`, and `97`.
+
+```bash
